100
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:12,600
And about the same rate as the general community,

101
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,840
about one in 10 over 65,

102
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,960
except for folks with Down syndrome.

103
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:20,900
And they have a much higher rate.

104
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:25,800
And it's because that 21st chromosome has the gene

105
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:28,860
that creates those proteins,

106
00:07:29,060 --> 00:07:30,760
which become plaques and tangles,

107
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:31,900
which damage the brain.

108
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:34,040
And so they have three,

109
00:07:34,340 --> 00:07:37,380
or at least partial, one, two, and a partial.

110
00:07:37,380 --> 00:07:39,660
So they just have a lot more of that,

111
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,980
protein being produced in their brain,

112
00:07:42,140 --> 00:07:43,960
which puts them at just as much higher risk.

113
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:48,220
About 70% of folks with Down syndrome,

114
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:50,260
age 35 and over,

115
