will probably experience some form of dementia,

116
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,680
most likely Alzheimer's.

117
00:07:57,100 --> 00:08:00,500
And the length of it is different

118
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:02,300
from the general community.

119
00:08:02,500 --> 00:08:04,180
And rather than eight to 10 years,

120
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:06,680
we're often talking two to five years.

121
00:08:07,180 --> 00:08:09,660
Some of us, because we do a really bad job,

122
